# .NET

- Target framework per repo SDK (see global.json or README); do not downgrade without request.
- No business logic in controllers/pages; use Application services.
- EF migrations: one migration per logical change; update snapshot.
- Configuration: `appsettings.json` for non-secret defaults; secrets in `appsettings.*.local.json` (gitignored).
- Integration tests: use existing test factories patterns in `tests/`.